{"id": "66238", "title": "金砖记", "author": "玖玖", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66238.htm", "intro": "余33版文案：我教你文化，你带我临床。\r\n金砖女带球跑，小正太痴情追。\r\n女大不中留，带个娃娃留成愁。\r\n男大难伺候，少年夫妻样样愁。\r\n\r\n肥猫三版文案：上保险吧，找个有前途有潜力的男人当人身保险上了吧。这样，就算出了意外搞出人命也不怕，可能讨要保险金的时间长了点，不过没关系，迟早你能从保险公司那里抱到金砖。\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 豪门世家", "base": "files/article/html/66/66238", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9954855.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9954856.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9954857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9954858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9954859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9954860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9954861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9954862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9954863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9954864.html", "available": false}]}